Source: made for docsluice by scripts/corpus/make-xlsb.mjs from corpus/xlsx/workbook-values-formulas.xlsx
Requirements: XLS-2, XLS-3, XLS-4
Notes: written from the [MS-XLSB] specification; LibreOffice 24.2.7.2 imports it with the same values and formats. Formula cells store their cached value as a constant formula.
